### Response Parameters

{% include '_generic_v4_response.md.j2' %}

#### data

This API returns approval task information only and **returns no execution result**, because the cron job status has not been changed yet. Note that `status` in the response is the approval task status, which is different from `status` in the request that stands for the target cron job status.

